ind":"announcement","title":"It's Over 9000!","summary":"From the entire FAKKU Games & Dead of the Brain Project Team, Thank You so much for 10,000 Wishlists on Steam!Hi, DocOliver here, resident Game Production Manager and QA Lead. To celebrate I wanted to give a little nod to some of the extra special inclusions to this game, what makes it different from our past games, and well what's an UNLOCK without a bit of spoilers... Along with being the first in our PC-98 Preservation Project, Dead of the Brain contains several other firsts for FAKKU Games.F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:51:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039077","verified_at":"2026-10-24T08:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5056390-1847286114033299","game_id":"steam-5056390","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"Following on from last week's blog about the evolution of pixel art on Japanese machines of the 80s and 90s, today we're jumping back to present day to see how our own pixel artist approached the task of editing some of the art from the original 1992 game.Hi! pixloen here, I'm the person brought on to help with pixel art for the Steam release (if you couldn't tell by the name)! The PC-98 is a very striking system when it comes to its art/visuals, so it's been quite exciting and enjoyable to work","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033299","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:03:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5056390-1846651706690639","game_id":"steam-5056390","kind":"announcement","title":"Dead of the Brain Demo Available Now!","summary":"Steam Next Fest has kicked off and the free demo of Dead of the Brain is now available!Just go to the green banner below the screenshots on the store page and click \"Download\"!We'd love to hear your feedback, so go ahead and post in the Steam discussion forum or hit us up on social media (links at the bottom of this post). And if you livestream your playthrough or write a review, make sure to let us know so we can promote your content too! >Wishlist & FollowDon't forget to wishlist the game, fol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690639","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5056390-1846651706674755","game_id":"steam-5056390","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1","summary":"Welcome to our first devlog! In this article, trentsignia from the WINE fan translation team takes us through the technical evolution of pixel art as shaped by developments in Japanese computing.Pixel art is a medium frequently defined by its limitations. It is tempting to consider the medium simplistic in light of such restrictions, but one only needs to trace the evolution of video game art to know that it is anything but. With color palettes from black-and-white to technicolor and screen size","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5056390-1846018067934067","game_id":"steam-5056390","kind":"announcement","title":"Dead of the Brain Demo Coming Soon!","summary":"FAKKU is excited to announce that Dead of the Brain will be part of the upcoming Steam Next Fest!The demo will be available to play from the start of the event on October 19.You'll be able to dive into this cult classic game from Fairytale, one of the pioneering developers of games for the PC-98 platform in the 1980s and 90s, playable on modern platforms for the first time ever.Wishlist & FollowDon't forget to wishlist the game, follow our Steam publisher page, and check us out on social media.X","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T17:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5056390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5056390":"2026-10-26T07:39:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5056390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:59Z"},"5354660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:00Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5056390","app_id":5056390,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f8084699d465de58c8e82467d005b3d2838015c60e0861b9bd6472dcfd78473b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A cult classic Japanese PC-98 horror adventure from 1992, resurrected for modern platforms. Investigate a zombie outbreak, survive gruesome encounters, and experience unforgettable pixel art terror in this point & click nightmare.","pub